+  <main class="main">
+    <header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb"><span>团队知识库</span><span>/</span><span>工程实践</span><span>/</span><b>Git 协作规范</b></div><div class="top-version">v1.0 <span>团队标准</span></div></header>
+    <section class="hero" id="overview" aria-labelledby="page-title">
+      <div class="eyebrow">THE WAY WE COLLABORATE</div>
